# cloud/ is a mirror of the GCS bucket: pipeline source that runs on Linux (deploy.sh, Python
# steps) and run artifacts with recorded SHA-256s. Keep text files LF on every platform so they
# stay byte-identical to the bucket objects; leave binaries untouched.
cloud/**            text=auto eol=lf
*.joblib            binary
*.onnx              binary
*.gz                binary
*.zst               binary
*.pgen              binary
*.zip               binary
*.wasm              binary
*.docx              binary
